join detective right
detective: There's a vase broken upstairs, and I need to know who broke it.
join cook left
cook: I believe I did hear a shatter at one point, though very faint.
cook: It was after Dracula collapsed and Narin and Aslan brought him upstairs.
cook: I had come outside to inform the guard about what had happened.
cook: I would imagine it was one of the two other vampires, unless Alin somehow snuck up there.
cook (unamused): I wouldn't put it past him.
